<title>USA: Liberty All-Star sets initial quarterly.</title>
<headline>Liberty All-Star sets initial quarterly.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty All-Star Growth Fund Inc said it declared its first quarterly distribution of $0.30 per share under the fund's new 10 percent distribution policy announced in February 1997.</p>
<p>The quarterly distribution is payable on May 7 to shareholders of record on March 21.</p>
<p>The prior distribution paid was a capital gains distribution of $1.02 per share.</p>
